    - [ ] Consistent timestamped metric envelope and documented units/field schema.
    - [ ] Global log search with stable paging and supported filters.
    - [ ] Real investigation queue dispatch (the API reports unavailable until it exists).
    - [ ] Investigation trigger references validated and linked to events.
    - [ ] API/dependency/worker health exposed separately from `/healthz`.
    
